---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Start Here: The Indian Financial Protection Blueprint"
  description="A first-principles roadmap for young Indian professionals, software engineers, and salaried employees purchasing their first insurance policy or auditing existing plans."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="space-y-8">
      <div class="border-b border-[#E5E3D8] pb-6">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0D5C46]">Foundational Pathway</span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold font-serif text-[#0F172A] mt-2">
          Start Here: The First-Principles Protection Blueprint
        </h1>
        <p class="text-base text-[#475569] mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          If you are a young Indian software engineer, salaried employee, or newly married professional looking at life insurance for the first time, follow this 4-step sequence to avoid multi-decade financial errors.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step-by-Step Blueprint Cards -->
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <!-- Step 1 -->
        <div class="bg-white border border-[#E5E3D8] rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#0D5C46] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">1</span>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-[#0F172A]">Separate Risk Protection from Capital Accumulation</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#334155] leading-relaxed">
            The most expensive financial mistake in India is buying a bundled product (Endowment, Money-Back, or ULIP) that tries to insure your life while simultaneously investing your money.
          </p>
          <div class="bg-[#FAF9F5] p-4 rounded border border-[#E5E3D8] text-xs space-y-2 text-[#475569]">
            <p><strong>The First-Principles Rule:</strong> Insurance is an expense to protect against catastrophic loss. Investments are vehicles to compound capital at maximum post-tax real returns.</p>
            <p>When you combine them, you end up with <em>inadequate protection</em> (₹5 Lakh to ₹15 Lakh cover) and <em>mediocre returns</em> (5% to 6% IRR).</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/cover-and-capital-india/articles/term-plus-investing-vs-bundled-insurance/" class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#0D5C46] hover:underline inline-block mt-2">
            Read Mathematical Proof: Buy Term & Invest Difference &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2 -->
        <div class="bg-white border border-[#E5E3D8] rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#0D5C46] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">2</span>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-[#0F172A]">Calculate Your Exact Life Cover Need</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#334155] leading-relaxed">
            Never pick an arbitrary number like "₹50 Lakh" or "₹1 Crore" based on advertisements. Calculate your Human Life Value based on actual living expenses, home loans, and future obligations.
          </p>
          <div class="bg-[#F0FDF4] p-4 rounded border border-[#BBF7D0] text-xs text-[#166534]">
            <strong>Use Our In-Memory Calculator:</strong> Input your annual household expenses, years of dependants' dependency, outstanding loans, and current liquid assets.
          </div>
          <a href="/cover-and-capital-india/calculators/" class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#0D5C46] hover:underline inline-block mt-2">
            Launch Life Cover Need Estimator &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3 -->
        <div class="bg-white border border-[#E5E3D8] rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#0D5C46] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">3</span>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-[#0F172A]">Buy Pure Term Insurance with Regular Pay</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#334155] leading-relaxed">
            Once your cover need is determined, purchase a pure term policy directly from the insurer's website:
          </p>
          <ul class="text-xs text-[#475569] space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-5">
            <li>Choose <strong>Regular Pay</strong> (avoid paying upfront in limited pay unless your earning career is short).</li>
            <li>Cover yourself until your planned retirement age (age 60 to 65). Avoid expensive whole-life cover to age 99.</li>
            <li>Disclose all medical and habit details (tobacco, alcohol, family history) with 100% transparency.</li>
            <li>Enact the policy under <strong>Section 6 Married Women's Property Act (MWPA)</strong> if you have a wife and children.</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/cover-and-capital-india/articles/term-insurance-coverage-premiums-exclusions/" class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#0D5C46] hover:underline inline-block mt-2">
            Read Comprehensive Term Insurance Guide &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 4 -->
        <div class="bg-white border border-[#E5E3D8] rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#0D5C46] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">4</span>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-[#0F172A]">Audit Any Existing Old Policies</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#334155] leading-relaxed">
            If you were sold an endowment policy, money-back plan, or child plan in the past by a relative or bank manager, do not panic and do not cancel impulsively.
          </p>
          <div class="bg-[#FFFBEB] p-4 rounded border border-[#FDE68A] text-xs text-[#92400E]">
            <strong>The Golden Rule:</strong> Ensure your new pure term insurance policy is approved and active BEFORE touching or surrendering any old cover. Then evaluate whether to keep, make paid-up, or surrender.
          </div>
          <a href="/cover-and-capital-india/articles/surrendering-or-keeping-existing-policy/" class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#0D5C46] hover:underline inline-block mt-2">
            Read Surrender vs Paid-Up Decision Guide &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
